    https://github.com/HandyOrg/HandyControl/blob/master/src/Shared/HandyControl_Shared/Themes/Styles/Base/ScrollViewerBaseStyle.xaml
    https://github.com/HandyOrg/HandyControl/blob/master/src/Shared/HandyControl_Shared/Themes/Styles/ScrollViewer.xaml
    
